{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And now, behold.</b> The sense of \"behold\": the cry of the children of Israel, for they repented." "And the sense of \"and I have also seen the oppression\" — that they dealt viciously against them. And so it says similarly: \"for in the thing by which they schemed against them\" (Exodus 18:11)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:31:13.036563686Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}